{
  "uid": "octogee-gateway-sizing",
  "title": "Gateways \u2014 Right-Sizing",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "octogee",
    "gateway"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Gateways",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "gateway"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Managed Prometheus",
          "value": "Managed Prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(kube_pod_info, namespace)",
          "refId": "ns"
        },
        "regex": "/^(octogee|octogee-west|octogee-test|octogee-test-west)$/",
        "current": {
          "text": "octogee",
          "value": "octogee"
        },
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "gwpod",
        "label": "Gateway pod",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(kube_pod_info{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"octogee-gateway-.*\"}, pod)",
          "refId": "gwpod"
        },
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this board",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Right-size the `gateway` container's tier from real peak usage.** Gateways run **Guaranteed QoS** (requests == limits), so a pod can't burst past its tier \u2014 under-sizing surfaces as **OOMKills** (memory) or **CPU throttling**, never as >100% usage.\n\n- **Peak mem % of limit** is the binding signal \u2014 pick the **smallest tier that keeps peak under ~70%**.\n- **CPU throttled %** sustained above 0 means the agent wants more cores than the tier grants \u2192 size up.\n- **Window = the dashboard time range.** Set it to **7d\u201330d** (Prometheus retains 30d) for a real signal; the default `now-6h` is too short to size on.\n\nTiers (cpu / mem): xs 0.5 / 2Gi \u00b7 s 1 / 4Gi \u00b7 m 2 / 8Gi \u00b7 **l 4 / 16Gi (default and ceiling)**."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-instance headroom \u2014 peak over the selected range",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Right-sizing summary (gateway container)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max_over_time(sum by(pod)(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\"}[5m]))[$__range:5m])",
          "legendFormat": "cpu_peak",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by(pod)(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\",resource=\"cpu\"})",
          "legendFormat": "cpu_lim",
          "refId": "B",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "100 * max_over_time(sum by(pod)(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\"}[5m]))[$__range:5m]) / sum by(pod)(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\",resource=\"cpu\"})",
          "legendFormat": "cpu_pct",
          "refId": "C",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max_over_time(sum by(pod)(container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\"})[$__range:5m]) / 1073741824",
          "legendFormat": "mem_peak_gib",
          "refId": "D",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by(pod)(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\",resource=\"memory\"}) / 1073741824",
          "legendFormat": "mem_lim_gib",
          "refId": "E",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "100 * max_over_time(sum by(pod)(container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\"})[$__range:5m]) / sum by(pod)(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\",resource=\"memory\"})",
          "legendFormat": "mem_pct",
          "refId": "F",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "pod": "Gateway pod",
              "Value #A": "Peak CPU (cores)",
              "Value #B": "CPU limit (cores)",
              "Value #C": "CPU % of limit",
              "Value #D": "Peak mem (GiB)",
              "Value #E": "Mem limit (GiB)",
              "Value #F": "Mem % of limit"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "CPU",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU cores \u2014 used vs limit",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by(pod)(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} used",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by(pod)(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\",resource=\"cpu\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} limit",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU throttled %",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Sustained above 0 \u2192 the gateway is CPU-starved at this tier; size up.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "100 * sum by(pod)(rate(container_cpu_cfs_throttled_periods_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum by(pod)(rate(container_cpu_cfs_periods_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\"}[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Memory",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory working set \u2014 used vs limit",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by(pod)(container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} used",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by(pod)(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\",resource=\"memory\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} limit",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Gateway pods OOM-killed (range)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=\"gateway\",reason=\"OOMKilled\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-container breakdown (gateway vs gateway-edge sidecar)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU by container",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by(pod,container)(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=~\"gateway|gateway-edge\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}/{{container}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory by container",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by(pod,container)(container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$gwpod\",container=~\"gateway|gateway-edge\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}/{{container}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 34
      }
    }
  ]
}
